    {
      "modelVersion": "gemini-2.5-flash",
      "content": {
        "parts": [
          {
            "text": "Aquí tienes la consulta SQL para BigQuery que cuenta las ocurrencias de episodios de condición clínica, estratificadas por año, grupo de edad decenal y género:\n\n```sql\nSELECT\n    EXTRACT(YEAR FROM ce.condition_era_start_date) AS era_year,\n    FLOOR(CAST((EXTRACT(YEAR FROM ce.condition_era_start_date) - p.year_of_birth) / 10 AS BIGNUMERIC)) * 10 AS age_group_start,\n    c_gender.concept_name AS gender,\n    COUNT(ce.person_id) AS condition_era_count\nFROM\n    condition_era ce\nJOIN\n    person p\nON\n    ce.person_id = p.person_id\nJOIN\n    concept c_gender\nON\n    p.gender_concept_id = c_gender.concept_id\nGROUP BY\n    1, 2, 3\nORDER BY\n    1, 2, 3;\n```\n"
          }
        ],
        "role": "model"
      },
